<title>COLOMBIA: BP urges change in Colombian contract terms.</title>
<headline>BP urges change in Colombian contract terms.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Petroleum Co Plc issued a public appeal Friday for better contract terms to exploit the oil-rich Piedemonte field in Colombia's eastern plains.</p>
<p>The appeal came in a public statement from BP's Colombian subsidiary, BP Exploration Co (Colombia) Ltd., outlining its position on the Piedemonte development in advance of a congressional hearing on the issue set for next Tuesday.</p>
</text>
